WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.770
Now, why don't you hurry up and change into those dirty prison uniforms?

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.320
Are you going to make
us do it here and now?!

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.490
Of course.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.530
This is how you treated all the the prisoners to date after all.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:21.220
Isn't that right, Meiko?

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.930
You little...

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:26.640
Tell me, Mari. Doesn't this pig seem lacking in manners?

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:30.830
She's been constantly defying me.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:34.090
Perhaps I should teach her some manners, don't you think?

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.070
President!

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.280
Wait.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:52.140
First, we need to do a full body check to make sure you're not bringing anything extra within the prison.

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:54.910
A very thorough check-up.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:56.050
Risa?

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:01.550
<i>This bitch...</i>

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:02.430
<i>...blocked our attacks?!</i>

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:03.950
Stop it.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:04.970
Stop, both of you.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:06.660
I'm going to be fine.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:09.330
Don't fall to Student Council President Kate's provocations.

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:12.020
Provocations? What are you talking about?

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:14.800
You're trying to make us act problematically on purpose...

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.610
...so that you can extend
our sentences, right?

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:18.530
I wouldn't put it past you.

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:19.390
Huh?

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:21.350
That doesn't sound like
something <i>I</i>'d do, Mari.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:24.290
It's more like how <i>you
</i> treated the boys, isn't it?

00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:27.920
To think you would play
innocent and blame <i>me</i>.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:31.290
You truly are a low person.

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:33.680
Do you understand, Mari?

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:37.460
The three of you have been recognized
as prisoners by the chairman.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:40.600
That way your guards will be us, the Student Council.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.000
The real one, of course.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:15.630
Ah, food eaten in the
free world tastes great!

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.070
Indeed it does.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.150
What is it, Kiyoshi?

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:23.010
Is your arm still messed up because of Hana-san's kick?

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.220
<i>Still</i>? It happened three days ago.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:28.380
However, what Hana-dono
did was truly vicious.

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:32.090
Perhaps we should have requested
a more severe punishment after all.

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:34.920
No need, this isn't that big of a deal.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:38.190
<i>I effectively deceived Hana-san.</i>

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:41.350
<i>Maybe this is my just deserts.</i>

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:44.200
<i>That kiss though...</i>

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.610
<i>Now that I remember it, it was amazing.</i>

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.710
Are you okay, Kiyoshi-kun?

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:50.800
Chiyo-chan! I'm sorry!

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:52.620
You've got it wrong! You've got it wrong!!

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:53.440
Huh?

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:55.920
Ah, I'm sorry. Did I surprise you?

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.990
N-No, sorry. My bad.

00:03:57.990 --> 00:03:59.680
I spaced out for a second.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.050
Here, let me borrow your chopsticks.

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:02.690
What?

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:05.100
Here.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.000
<i>Here?</i>

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.840
C'mon, say "aah!"

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.520
Chiyo-chan, what are yo-

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:14.050
Kiyoshi-kun, with your injury and all it looks like you're always in pain when you eat.

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:15.100
I couldn't just stand here and watch!

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.920
Chiyo-dono, have you lost your mind?!

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:18.400
Fraternization with the opposite sex should be forbidden!

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.420
Such shameless acts, in public...

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.150
This isn't shameless, I'm just nursing an injured person.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:26.380
Besides, weren't those rules made up by the Underground Student Council?

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:30.050
It is true that those girls are presently absent, but still...

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:32.940
Here, Kiyoshi-kun! Say "aah"!

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:33.750
Is it good?

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:34.450
It's really good.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.690
Damn you Kiyoshi, you've changed.

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:37.750
That piece of shit.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.980
His eyes were more dazzling when we were in prison.

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:44.030
Losing your backbone
in just three days...

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.030
Piece of shit.

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.870
What, are you jealous?

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:48.620
A-Anzu!

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:51.550
You're jealous over that? You're really a kid.

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:53.920
Here, I'll do it for you.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:54.680
Say "aah!"

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:57.380
St... Quit it. I ain't injured.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:00.440
Now, who was it who helped you get released from prison?

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.070
Alright, got it. Then...

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:05.160
Chiyo-chan...

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.150
Are the council members doing well?

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:10.500
Yeah, they're fine.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:14.480
Looks like they didn't tell the rest of the students the real reason behind their expulsion.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:19.670
The rumor is that they went too far to hurt you, Kiyoshi-kun.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:20.890
I see.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:24.840
Kiyoshi-kun, are you okay with nobody knowing the truth?

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.890
To be honest, I don't
really care about that.

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:29.520
Actually, Chiyo-chan... I'm sorry.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:34.060
Because of us, you and your sister got involved in this mess.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:36.710
Kiyoshi-kun?

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:38.450
Say "aah".

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.830
Kiyoshi-dono and Shingo-dono have completely lost their nerve!

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:42.320
Men should act like life is a batterfield!

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.130
The first step to victory is
to fasten one's helm-

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:45.730
They say you're a hardcore masochist!

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:47.440
Really? That's kinda cute!

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:49.120
Hey, can I punch
your stomach? Can I?

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.560
Uhm, that's...That's fine.

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:54.060
Amazing! He doesn't even flinch!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:59.230
Damn you all, this is too miserable.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:00.830
Excuse me.

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:10.570
At times like this, I should relieve the stress by reading the Records of the Three Kingdoms...

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:12.970
That book is...

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.900
It's the super rare book
I've been searching for!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:25.880
Uhm...

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:28.300
<i>Don't get the wrong impression, Gakuto!</i>

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.940
<i>There's no way a girl would ever talk to the guy who shat his pants. Absolutely no way!</i>

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:32.880
Uhm, hey.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.230
The Records of the Three Kingdoms.

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:35.940
Do you like it?

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:39.140
If you like it, maybe
we could read it together?

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.740
T-t-t-t-troubles are approaching!

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:45.100
So, next question.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:48.210
Which one would you pick between an air conditioner, an electric fan or a paper fan?

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:50.120
Uhm... A paper fan?

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:53.050
Wow, a paper fan! That's interesting.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:57.190
Then, how many times a friend you fought with should apologize before you forgave them?

00:06:57.370 --> 00:07:00.420
Well... Three times, I guess.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.990
<i>What's going on? What is all this chuckling and giggling?</i>

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:05.350
<i>This can't be real, maybe
it's some sort of trap?</i>

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:08.210
Okay, I got the results of the fortune telling.

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:10.770
Gakuto-kun, your type
is "Zhuge Kongming".

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:14.540
What an honor! Then I am someone as respected as Guan Yu!

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:17.270
Some people have even called me the Kongming of Nerima... uh?

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:19.400
Why do you know my name?

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:22.480
Well, there are only five guys.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:26.600
And besides, Gakuto-kun... I mean, you're famous.

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:28.150
I... I see.

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:31.930
I suppose there aren't many people in this school who don't know that. Well...

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.860
Oh, right. I'm Yokoyama Mitsuko.

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:36.140
Nice to meet you.

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:37.780
You can call me Mitsuko.

00:07:37.780 --> 00:07:40.240
Wh-What are you doing with that hand?

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:42.630
Uhm, a handshake?

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:46.040
Mitsuko-dono, as you must be aware, I'm a...

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:50.230
I'm... I'm... I'm a man who shat his pants!

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:54.060
What would people say about you if they knew you merely associated and read a book with such a human being?

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:55.960
And as for a day where I would shake your hand, I-

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:05.150
That happened to me too.
I understand your feelings, Gakuto-kun.

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:07.130
Well, it was in kindergarten.

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:09.110
But you absolutely can't tell anyone.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:10.810
<i>I truly...</i>

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:13.810
Oh, right! If you're a Kongming type, there's a book over there that I'd recommend to you.

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:15.420
<i>I truly made it out of prison...</i>

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:16.080
Let's go.

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:19.120
<i>I'm so glad!!</i>

00:08:19.550 --> 00:08:21.170
Ah, there it is.

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:24.920
Kongming slipped through time
and commanded the Japanese Army.

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:27.570
Then I guess he was as bold as-

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:31.060
I guess I can't get it
without a stepladder.

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:34.580
Excuse me, can I borrow
that stepladder next?

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.600
Oh, okay!

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:39.070
Mitsuko-dono, your skirt is... Well...

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:40.860
Huh? My skirt?

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:41.700
N-No!

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:43.410
Look out!!

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:48.790
Alright.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.200
Are you having fun, Watanabe and Egawa?

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:53.280
Heh, looks like you're in high spirits.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:56.740
I'm really the happiest
when I'm with you guys.

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:58.690
Kiyotake?

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:01.550
Kiyotake!

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:03.070
Kiyotake is missing!!

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:05.910
Where are you?
Where are you, Kiyotake?!

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:09.390
It can't be...

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:11.420
He's with this group of ants?!

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:17.990
Please don't step on the-

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:20.600
Wow, that guy was scary.

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:21.460
Let's go.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:22.670
Disgusting.

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:25.500
Where are you, Kiyotake?

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.250
Kiyotake...

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.130
You stupid bastard...

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:33.190
I was so worried.

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:34.930
What the hell was that for?

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:38.460
I guess you were wishing for freedom and tried to leave...

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:42.520
That's right, Kiyotake.

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:44.840
Even if you get out of here...

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:47.940
There's nothing fun expecting you.

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:51.080
Are you all right, Mitsuko-dono?

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.450
Ouch...

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:00.880
<i>Troubles!!</i>

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:03.740
I am truly glad I made it out of prison!

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:07.170
I wish... I wish I had never left prison.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:08.460
What did you say?!

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:09.880
Hold up, Gakuto!

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.700
Not only you went on a date with a girl-

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.310
You got to see her ass too?
What are you talking about?!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:19.100
It wasn't a date. We simply read a book together in the library.

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:22.650
Then we determined that according to the Three Kingdoms fortune telling I am Kongming...

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:23.950
No one cares about that!

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:26.630
How was that Yokoyama
Mitsuko-san girl's ass?!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:29.620
I was rather surprised so I don't remember that particularly well.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:33.170
That sort of thing can happen, but what if it was a trap?

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:35.810
<i>She</i> invited you, right Gakuto?

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:37.210
Maybe she was trying to seduce you.

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:39.350
Mitsuko-dono is
not that sort of lady!

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:42.090
That was... God's doing,
or an accident, or-

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.840
A honeytrap.

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:44.880
That must be it.

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:50.000
But is it? You saw her panties, bumped into the stepladder, the bookshelf toppled and her panties came off?

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.200
That girl sounds like the Rube Goldberg of klutzes.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:54.500
Don't give Mitsuko-dono bizarre nicknames!

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.490
But that's all we know about her, right?

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:58.640
She definitely sounds like
a Rube Goldberg klutz.

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:00.150
Right?

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:01.940
Don't laugh at her!

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:03.520
Sorry Gakuto, my bad.

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:06.710
But I'm really glad you
made friends with a girl.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:09.410
Well...

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:11.130
What's that "well"?

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:13.830
Aren't you the bastard who called us weak or something?

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.840
Let's not talk about that.

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:18.010
And to think you shat your pants too.

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:19.950
Let's not talk about that either.

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:32.250
What are you doing, Joe-kun?

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.320
Nothing much.

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:34.560
Leave me alone.

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:36.690
Wanna head back to the room?

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:38.380
Things are really heating up in there.

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:41.730
We thought we'd all try to plan Gakuto's next date.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.490
Leave me alone.

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:47.380
Just leave me alone!

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:52.630
What's wrong, Joe-kun?

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:54.510
I wasn't...

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:59.150
I wasn't born with the skills you all have.

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:02.550
It was nice, when we were inside.

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:04.490
Inside the prison, with its iron bars.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.860
I hated it at first, but then I grew accustomed to it.

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:11.620
By the end, those bars had become something I could rely on.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:12.560
I haven't...

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:17.170
I haven't been able to sleep since I was born, in this world where there's nothing I can rely on!

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:19.410
I took sleeping pills too,
but I still can't sleep!

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.260
But we're here, you can rely on us.

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:26.180
I've already told you, I wasn't born with the skills you all have.

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:29.410
You've all managed to do well.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.680
Kiyoshi and Shingo got
close to some of the girls.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:36.620
Andre, even you've been able to find girls you get along with.

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:42.060
And now you're telling me that even pants-shitter Gakuto has managed to become friends with a girl?!

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:43.770
I'm not...

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:45.690
I'm not like you.

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:47.090
At all.

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:52.020
Joe-kun...

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:54.820
Gakuto-kun!

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:57.250
Are you reading something today, too?

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.740
Mitsuko-dono!

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:01.020
What a coincidence to meet you again!

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:02.450
It's not a coincidence.

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:05.780
I come here every day during lunch break.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:07.960
What? I do too!

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:12.450
<i>I knew it, Mitsuko-dono is truly</i> not <i>a Rube Goldberg klutz like the others say!</i>

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:15.900
<i>She's a wonderful lady who loves books and The Three Kingdoms!</i>

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:17.880
Gakuto-kun, are you okay?

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:20.670
Ah, I spaced out for a second.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.220
What's up with you?
I'll help you pick them up.

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:28.430
<i>It can't be... Is she really a Rube Goldberg klutz... ?!</i>

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:31.720
Mitsuko-dono, behind you... Your skirt...

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:33.450
Huh? Behind me?

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:34.870
Ah, stop it!

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:35.460
<i>T...</i>

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:37.920
<i>Troubles!!</i>

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:40.330
<i>How embarrassing, Mitsuko-dono!!</i>

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:46.020
<i>Inside the prison, I was one fifth of a man.</i>

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:49.720
<i>Inside the prison, my life certainly had a meaning.</i>

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.240
<i>But now?</i>

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:52.820
<i>I'm a thirtieth of a man.</i>

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:57.500
<i>No, at most one part of 2000... the fraction is so small there's no number for it!</i>

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.670
<i>I'm done with this.</i>

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:01.650
<i>There's no place for me in the free world.</i>

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.630
<i>I want to go home.</i>

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:06.920
<i>I know how I can go back there.</i>

